            "review_title": "Review at Wrap&roll Gigamall, Thu Duc City",
            "review_text": "Snickers444\nDracut, Massachusetts88 contributions\n0\nGive it a try\nJul 2024 • Solo\nhis was my third trip to This Wrap City. I've had Bangkok Nights, Cape Codder, and Plymouth County wraps. All were very good. My favorite was Bangkok Nights as it was so unusual. The Bangkok and Plymouth County were toasted, which added a crispy texture. Nice touch. They also have salads, sandwiches and flatbreads that are quite creative. Homemade kettle chips are good. There are a few tables for dine in. Most people seem to do take out. I always eat in. Not your usual lunch spot. Will keep returning.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten July 22, 2024",
